data_hfte2
# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [hfte2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# 1T-HfTe2, CdI2-type P-3m1 (#164), from Materials Project mp-32887.
# Hf occupies 1a at the origin; Te occupies 2d with z=0.228088. The Materials
# Project relaxed primitive hexagonal cell has a=4.01826066 A and c=7.628794 A.
# This P1 representation lists the symmetry mate at 1-z explicitly. Limiting
# checks: V=(sqrt(3)/2)a^2c, 1Hf+2Te, and finite
# F/chi/U for the allowed basal (001) reflection.
# Validation: hfte2-001-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 4.01826066
_cell_length_b 4.01826066
_cell_length_c 7.628794
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
